1
00:05:15,652 --> 00:05:21,652
Music was his world. Then silence revealed a new one.

2
00:10:31,304 --> 00:10:37,304
Sound of Metal is a drama, music film directed by Darius Marder.

3
00:15:46,956 --> 00:15:52,956
Metal drummer Ruben begins to lose his hearing.

4
00:21:02,608 --> 00:21:08,608
When a doctor tells him his condition will worsen, he
thinks his career and life is over.

5
00:26:18,260 --> 00:26:24,260
His girlfriend Lou checks the former addict into a rehab for the deaf hoping
it will prevent a relapse and help him adapt to his new life.

6
00:31:33,913 --> 00:31:39,913
After being welcomed and accepted just as he is, Ruben must choose
between his new normal and the life he once knew.

7
00:36:49,565 --> 00:36:55,565
Ruben Stone, played by Riz Ahmed.

8
00:42:05,217 --> 00:42:11,217
Lou, played by Olivia Cooke.

9
00:47:20,869 --> 00:47:26,869
Joe, played by Paul Raci.

10
00:52:36,521 --> 00:52:42,521
Diane, played by Lauren Ridloff.

11
00:57:52,173 --> 00:57:58,173
Richard Berger, played by Mathieu Amalric.

12
01:03:07,826 --> 01:03:13,826
Michael, played by Domenico Toledo.

13
01:08:23,478 --> 01:08:29,478
Sound of Metal is a 2019 American drama film directed by Darius Marder, who co-wrote the story with
Derek Cianfrance before co-writing the screenplay with his brother Abraham Marder.

14
01:13:39,130 --> 01:13:45,130
It stars Riz Ahmed as a metal drummer who loses his hearing.

15
01:18:54,782 --> 01:19:00,782
The cast also includes Olivia Cooke, Paul Raci,
Lauren Ridloff, and Mathieu Amalric.

16
01:24:10,434 --> 01:24:16,434
Sound of Metal had its world premiere in the Platform Prize program at the
2019 Toronto International Film Festival on September 6, 2019.

17
01:29:26,086 --> 01:29:32,086
Amazon Studios released the film in theaters on November 20,
2020, and on Amazon Prime Video on December 4.

18
01:34:41,739 --> 01:34:47,739
The film was critically acclaimed, with particular praise for the performances of
Ahmed and Raci, the sound design, the editing, direction, and screenplay.

19
01:39:57,391 --> 01:40:03,391
It was listed on 52 film critics' top-ten lists for 2020.

20
01:45:13,043 --> 01:45:19,043
At the 93rd Academy Awards, it was nominated for Best Picture, Best Original Screenplay, Best Actor
(Ahmed) and Best Supporting Actor (Raci), and won for Best Sound and Best Film Editing.

21
01:50:28,695 --> 01:50:34,695
The film explores themes of deaf, missouri, drums, heavy metal, addiction.

22
01:55:44,347 --> 01:55:50,347
The tone is emotional.
